# [Verified behavior]($section.id('verified-behavior'))

## [Claude retry limits]($section.id('claude-retry-limits'))

### [Claude stops repeating corrections when no work occurs]($section.id('claude-stops-repeating-corrections-when-no-work-occurs').attrs('verified'))

[claude]($text.attrs('tag')) [completion]($text.attrs('tag')) [retry-loop]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L7)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing Claude watcher now reports warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L236).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The correction turns repeatedly finish without using tools](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L248).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Only one correction is requested and the turns settle while publication stays guarded](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L255).

### [Denied publication does not restart Claude corrections]($section.id('denied-publication-does-not-restart-claude-corrections').attrs('verified'))

[claude]($text.attrs('tag')) [completion]($text.attrs('tag')) [protected-actions]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L12)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing Claude watcher now reports warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L236).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [An empty correction settles and publication is repeatedly denied](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L305).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Publication never executes and no further correction is submitted](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L255).

