## [Legacy debt]($section.id('legacy-debt'))

### [Inherited debt does not absorb new failures]($section.id('inherited-debt-does-not-absorb-new-failures').attrs('verified'))

[baseline]($text.attrs('tag')) [regressions]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L92)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [The session starts with 29 inherited warnings under the default policy](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L156).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent attempts completion and publication](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L176).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Completion and configured publication actions are allowed](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L184).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [A change increases the warning count to 30](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L189).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [The new failure guards completion](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L196).

### [Strict inherited-finding policy still permits inspection]($section.id('strict-inherited-finding-policy-still-permits-inspection').attrs('verified'))

[baseline]($text.attrs('tag')) [strict]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L99)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [Inherited findings are configured to block](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L163).
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) [The session starts with 29 inherited warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L156).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The agent attempts completion, publication, and inspection](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L176).
