# [Proposed behavior (not implemented)]($section.id('proposed-behavior-not-implemented'))

## [Changed-code cleanup]($section.id('changed-code-cleanup'))

### [Editing a function activates its inherited findings]($section.id('editing-a-function-activates-its-inherited-findings').attrs('proposed'))

[changed-code]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L117)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) A function has three inherited warnings and another function has twelve.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent changes the first function.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Its three warnings require cleanup while the other twelve remain backlog.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) Repair tools remain available while completion is guarded.

### [Changed code activates the cross-file findings it participates in]($section.id('changed-code-activates-the-cross-file-findings-it-participates-in').attrs('proposed'))

[changed-code]($text.attrs('tag')) [cross-file]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L128)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) An inherited finding involves functions in two files.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent changes one of those participating functions.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) That cross-file finding requires cleanup while unrelated findings remain backlog.

### [Disabling a rule is not a resolution]($section.id('disabling-a-rule-is-not-a-resolution').attrs('proposed'))

[rules]($text.attrs('tag')) [resolution]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L138)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) A finding requires cleanup in changed code.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) Its rule is disabled or its source path is excluded.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The finding is not recorded as fixed.

## [Finding age]($section.id('finding-age'))

### [Moving a finding preserves its identity and age]($section.id('moving-a-finding-preserves-its-identity-and-age').attrs('proposed'))

[identity]($text.attrs('tag')) [age]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L123)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) An inherited finding has a recorded identity and first-seen date.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) Unrelated lines are inserted above it or the agent session restarts.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Its identity and age remain unchanged and movement alone does not activate it.

### [Untouched debt escalates at its configured deadline]($section.id('untouched-debt-escalates-at-its-configured-deadline').attrs('proposed'))

[age]($text.attrs('tag')) [deadlines]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L133)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) An inherited finding has a project-configured deadline.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) A check runs after that deadline.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The finding escalates according to project policy without resetting its first-seen date.

## [Modes and limits]($section.id('modes-and-limits'))

### [Advisory mode reports failures without guarding]($section.id('advisory-mode-reports-failures-without-guarding').attrs('proposed'))

[modes]($text.attrs('tag')) [advisory]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L143)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project runs overwatch in advisory mode.
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) A change introduces a new failure.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent tries to finish.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Completion is allowed.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) The agent is told of the new failure.

### [Strict mode waits for a result of the latest edit]($section.id('strict-mode-waits-for-a-result-of-the-latest-edit').attrs('proposed'))

[modes]($text.attrs('tag')) [strict]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L150)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project runs overwatch in strict mode.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent edits and tries to finish before the checks have run on that edit.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) Completion is guarded until a result of the latest edit passes.

### [Edits wait while the agent is too far ahead of its checks]($section.id('edits-wait-while-the-agent-is-too-far-ahead-of-its-checks').attrs('proposed'))

[limits]($text.attrs('tag')) [max-ahead]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L155)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project allows the agent three edits ahead of its latest result.
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) Checks are still running on an earlier edit.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent attempts a fourth edit.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The edit waits for a result.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) Reading and running checks remain available.

### [Strict mode hands a lingering failure to a person]($section.id('strict-mode-hands-a-lingering-failure-to-a-person').attrs('proposed'))

[limits]($text.attrs('tag')) [red-budget]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L162)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project runs overwatch in strict mode with a budget of edits while red.
- [And]($text.attrs('given')) A new failure has been reported.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) The agent spends its budget without clearing the failure.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The turn stops and waits for a person instead of continuing.

### [A check that exceeds its time limit fails]($section.id('a-check-that-exceeds-its-time-limit-fails').attrs('proposed'))

[limits]($text.attrs('tag')) [timeout]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View proposal](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L168)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) The project sets a time limit on checks.
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) A run exceeds it.
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) The run is stopped and reported to the agent as a timeout.
- [And]($text.attrs('then')) A timeout is never recorded as inherited backlog.
